title: ch02_bark_market
location: ch02/haluna
---
Vendor [soft_smile]: Two days. Two days, and she's still helping me wrap fish. #line:ch02_bark_market_001
Vendor [sad]: Salt and stone. Her knots are neater than mine ever were. #line:ch02_bark_market_002
Rhen [neutral]: Who's leaving? You've wrapped enough for a whole crew. #line:ch02_bark_market_003
Vendor [neutral]: Hold this end, would you? The leaf tears if you pull it. #line:ch02_bark_market_004
